[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0010","text":"美琴？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0020","text":"怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0030","text":"啊，没什么\n只是看你好像有点累"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0040","text":"要是困了的话休息一下也行\n反正接下来就是回去了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0050","text":"谢谢，没事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0060","text":"……不过，还是稍微睡一下吧\n回去之后还想继续自主练习"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0070","text":"哈哈……\n真有美琴的风格"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0080","text":"不过，既然是这样\n你能好好休息我就放心了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0090","text":"嗯\n……到了之后，能叫我一下吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0100","text":"好\n交给我吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022500_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
